# <type>(<scope>): <short imperative description>
#
# Allowed types: feat, fix, perf, refactor, test, docs, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scope is optional and lowercase, for example: core, probe, models, engine,
# planner, tuner, runtime, store, cli, ui, docs, build, ci, release.
# Header limit: 100 characters. Do not end the subject with a period.
# Use "!" before ":" for a breaking change and add a BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
#
# Leave one blank line after the header, then provide:
#
# Changes:
# - Specific change.
# - Specific change.
#
# Reason:
# - Why the change is needed.
#
# Validation:
# - Exact command executed: observed result.
#
# If a section does not apply, explain why instead of inventing information.
